Package: hdmiosd
Architecture: any
Depends:
    ${shlibs:Depends},
    ${misc:Depends}
Description: On-screen DDC/CI controller for HDMI/DP displays
 hdmiosd discovers DDC/CI-capable monitors over Linux I2C and provides a
 wxWidgets canvas OSD to adjust brightness, contrast, color, and related
 VCP features (Device OSD), plus App OSD window settings stored in
 ~/.config/hdmiosd/settings.ini. Tabler icons are embedded via bas-cpp
 assets.
